--ENG--

I am pleased to present to you the rental offer for a two-room apartment of high standard, with an area of 43 m², located in an excellent location at Bajeczna 4A Street.

LOCATION:

The apartment is situated in the Grzegórzki district of Krakow, at Bajeczna 4A Street.

It is in close proximity to Galeria Krakowska, M1 Shopping Center, the Botanical Garden, the University of Economics (UEK), the PKP and PKM train stations, a Biedronka supermarket, the Main Market Square.

The historic Kazimierz district and the Old Town are also nearby. There are many restaurants in the area.

DESCRIPTION:

The apartment is located on the 4 floor and consists of:

- Living room with kitchenette;

- Bedroom;

- Bathroom;

- Hallway;

- Balcony.

ADDITIONAL INFORMATION:

- Available from now;

- District heating;

- excellent connection to the city center;

- Air conditioning.

PRICE:

2800 PLN – rental fee;

700 PLN – administrative fee;

electricity according to consumption;

commission for the agency;

2800 PLN - refundable deposit.

CONTACT:

Paweł Pasula

